    → tofu session drain <name|id|head>

drive  what tofu drive and tofu drive desk do, the steps they take, and what
  the requests step prints
  drive the desk app and keep its screenshots
    → tofu drive desk --out <dir>
  drive the app with no terminal and no model call
    → tofu drive <script> --plain

files  every path tofu uses in your home and in a project, and which one wins
